    "zh-CN": "[[term:smoothquant|SmoothQuant]]是一种常用的大模型[[term:quantization|量化]]方法，它的核心思想是？",
    "en-US": "What is the core idea of [[term:smoothquant|SmoothQuant]], a common large-model [[term:quantization|quantization]] method?"
  },
  "explanation": {
    "zh-CN": "[[term:smoothquant|SmoothQuant]]通过等价变换把[[term:quantization|量化]]难度从 activation 迁移到 weight，本质上是将 activation 的 scale 吸收到权重中。",
    "en-US": "[[term:smoothquant|SmoothQuant]] uses an equivalent transformation to move quantization difficulty from activations to weights. In essence, it absorbs the activation scale into the weights."
  },
